# One line ending on every OS: generated files (esm/, browser/, types/) are compared byte for byte with what the
# scripts write, and Windows checkouts used to turn them into CRLF (2026-10-27, the first Windows CI run).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
*.tgz binary
